Keep AW2 Lab emulation paused between bridge requests. Both frontends poll
without running the core. Lua queues a bounded frame budget; native code runs
it after the callback returns, avoiding recursive core execution inside Lua.
Qt also disables audio/video waits, local key merging, and UI unpause/step
while gated. Normal mGBA behavior is unchanged unless AW2_MGBA_FRAME_GATE=1.

